flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Log in]
    B --> C{Product registered?}
    C -- No --> D[Register product and warranty] --> E
    C -- Yes --> E[Create claim: fault date, description, damage type]
    E --> F[Upload receipt, warranty card, photos, repair report]
    F --> G{File type and size valid?}
    G -- No --> F1[Show error, ask for another file] --> F
    G -- Yes --> H[OCR extracts invoice no., date, serial, amount]
    H --> I[User reviews and corrects extracted fields]
    I --> J[Claim preparation check:<br/>missing fields, documents, deadlines, contradictions]
    J --> K{User submits?}
    K -- No --> K1[Save as Draft] --> Z([End])
    K -- Yes --> L[Pre-process claim into features]
    L --> M1[Python model prediction]
    L --> M2[Render Claim Summary Card<br/>then Teachable Machine prediction]
    M1 --> N[Compare classes and confidence difference]
    M2 --> N
    N --> O[Warranty rules, contradictions,<br/>missing documents, duplicates]
    O --> P{Final decision}
    P -- Likely Valid --> Q1[Status: Approved]
    P -- Likely Invalid --> Q2[Status: Rejected]
    P -- Manual Review Required --> Q3[Status: Manual Review]
    Q3 --> R[Reviewer approves, rejects,<br/>requests info or overrides]
    Q1 & Q2 & R --> S[Notify user, write audit entry]
    S --> Z
